{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他仍对当初忍下的气不服，但已经跟自己争得没了力气，想到如今不在那些人身边就觉得难受。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、愤怒、悲伤、眷恋、失落、疲惫\",\n      \"missed\": \"过去开心的事都不敢多想这一层原因，以及“夜色里并肩低语”“旧日记忆又有温度”等具体回忆画面，需要逐句读。右上角两条主题提示字太小，不容易扫到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他还没有真正放下过去的不服气，只是争得累了，意识到自己已经不在那些人身边，因此感到难受。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、疲惫、失落、悲伤、眷恋\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的“脚下地板忽然不见”能扫到是一个画面，但它具体对应人物怎样的感受不够直观，需要再读主句才能建立联系。过去的回忆细节仍然不容易一次抓全。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他不是想通了，而是跟自己争到精疲力尽，不服气逐渐消退，想到如今和那些人分开就难受。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"疲惫、失落、悲伤、躁动不安、眷恋\",\n      \"missed\": \"“不是想通只是累了”很容易抓到，是这一张最明确的情绪总结；但“脚下地板忽然不见”“一声深深的叹息”需要进一步理解其对应的处境，“躁动不安加深”和“抵抗得累了”也容易与其他疲惫类短语混在一起。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两段大字主句都比较长，下面又有多条同等醒目的短语。颜色和上下位置能帮助区分两组内容，整体也能看出从不服气到疲惫难受的变化；但具体画面、情绪和人物处境之间的对应关系并非都能一眼确认。尤其第三张蓝色短语增加后，虽然“不是想通只是累了”强化了核心意思，但其他短语之间有一定重复，分散了注意力。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "753465be-6cd8-4297-8f5b-dc1f53521ef8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T004105519772Z", "elapsed_seconds": 73.985, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:42:19.499442+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "383eecc8ce3ce80efa9d62e2aaae101126e3b609eff0a5bd73324a234d523b1a", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T004105519772Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "6a2d697febce5e26498a6e57cb5c6156c41e59f6992c7f3a34b926bcb8794aae"}}}
